## One deviation, named

**`.claude/agents/orchestrate.md:388` and `:417` were edited** (same two replacements). Not in the named file list, but the brief's own verify command requires zero `after each doc write` hits in `.claude/agents`, and the agent text cannot be synced there by any of the three named commands because `.claude/agents` is an authored tree, not a generated one (`sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs:37-39`). The repository gate proved it was required: `check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs --all` returned `DRIFT orchestrate [claude] missing=["--quiet","spec-authoring-card.md"]` with `exit=1`; after the edit it returns `11 agent(s) checked — all mirrors in sync — OK`, `exit=0`. No other file in that tree was touched.

